---

---

<div
  class="flex flex-col w-full h-4/6 items-center justify-center gap-10 rounded-md"
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-black">Nuestros servicios</h1>

  <div class="w-5/6 grid grid-cols-1 smCustom:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 text-sm md:text-base">
    <div
      class="bg-button group shadow-button hover:shadow-button-hover hover:scale-110 rounded-md hover:border-blue-500 transition-all duration-300 w-3/3 h-auto py-5 px-1 gap-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-between border-2 border-gray-700"
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke-width="1.5"
        stroke="currentColor"
        class="size-7 group-hover:size-8 group-hover:text-blue-500 transition duration-300 ease-in-out"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M13.5 21v-7.5a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h3a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75V21m-4.5 0H2.36m11.14 0H18m0 0h3.64m-1.39 0V9.349M3.75 21V9.349m0 0a3.001 3.001 0 0 0 3.75-.615A2.993 2.993 0 0 0 9.75 9.75c.896 0 1.7-.393 2.25-1.016a2.993 2.993 0 0 0 2.25 1.016c.896 0 1.7-.393 2.25-1.015a3.001 3.001 0 0 0 3.75.614m-16.5 0a3.004 3.004 0 0 1-.621-4.72l1.189-1.19A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 5.378 3h13.243a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 1.06.44l1.19 1.189a3 3 0 0 1-.621 4.72M6.75 18h3.75a.75.75 0 0 0 .75-.75V13.5a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75H6.75a.75.75 0 0 0-.75.75v3.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75Z"
        ></path>
      </svg>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-600">Marketing</h2>
      <p class="max-w-48 text-xs text-center text-gray-500 flex-1">
        Administra tu negocio de la mejor manera
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="bg-button group shadow-button hover:shadow-button-hover hover:scale-110 rounded-md hover:border-blue-500 transition-all duration-300 w-3/3 h-auto py-5 px-1 gap-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-between border-2 border-gray-700"
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke-width="1.5"
        stroke="currentColor"
        class="size-7 group-hover:size-8 group-hover:text-blue-500 transition duration-300 ease-in-out"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M7.5 14.25v2.25m3-4.5v4.5m3-6.75v6.75m3-9v9M6 20.25h12A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 20.25 18V6A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18 3.75H6A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3.75 6v12A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 6 20.25Z"
        ></path>
      </svg>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-600">Ventas</h2>
      <p class="max-w-48 text-xs text-center text-gray-500 flex-1">
        ¡Asegura la Eficiencia y el Éxito para tu tienda mayorista!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="bg-button group shadow-button hover:shadow-button-hover hover:scale-110 rounded-md hover:border-blue-500 transition-all duration-300 w-3/3 h-auto py-5 px-1 gap-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-between border-2 border-gray-700"
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        fill="none"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        stroke-width="1.5"
        stroke="currentColor"
        class="size-7 group-hover:size-8 group-hover:text-blue-500 transition duration-300 ease-in-out"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          d="M2.25 3h1.386c.51 0 .955.343 1.087.835l.383 1.437M7.5 14.25a3 3 0 0 0-3 3h15.75m-12.75-3h11.218c1.121-2.3 2.1-4.684 2.924-7.138a60.114 60.114 0 0 0-16.536-1.84M7.5 14.25 5.106 5.272M6 20.25a.75.75 0 1 1-1.5 0 .75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0Zm12.75 0a.75.75 0 1 1-1.5 0 .75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0Z"
        ></path>
      </svg>

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-600">Experiencia</h2>
      <p class="max-w-48 text-xs text-center text-gray-500 flex-1">
        Mejora tus inventarios con estrategias sencillas para tu
        tienda
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="bg-button group shadow-button hover:shadow-button-hover hover:scale-110 rounded-md hover:border-blue-500 transition-all duration-300 w-3/3 h-auto py-5 px-1 gap-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-between border-2 border-gray-700"
      >
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 0 0 3.741-.479 3 3 0 0 0-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0 1 12 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 0 1 6 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 0 0-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0 0 12 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 0 0-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 0 0-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 0 0 3.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 0 0-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 1 1-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4.5 0Zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 1 1-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4.5 0Z" />
      </svg>
    
    
    <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-600">Crecimiento</h2>
      <p class="max-w-48 text-xs text-center text-gray-500 flex-1">
        somos los aliados de tu negocio y queremos verte crecer.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
    class="bg-button group shadow-button hover:shadow-button-hover hover:scale-110 rounded-md hover:border-blue-500 transition-all duration-300 w-3/3 h-auto py-5 px-1 gap-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-between border-2 border-gray-700"
    >
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18 9 11.25l4.306 4.306a11.95 11.95 0 0 1 5.814-5.518l2.74-1.22m0 0-5.94-2.281m5.94 2.28-2.28 5.941" />
    </svg>
    

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-600">Soluciones</h2>
      <p class="max-w-48 text-xs text-center text-gray-500 flex-1">
        te ofrecemos la primera solución digital para controlar tus finanzas, gestionar tu inventario
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="bg-button group shadow-button hover:shadow-button-hover hover:scale-110 rounded-md hover:border-blue-500 transition-all duration-300 w-3/3 h-auto py-5 px-1 gap-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-between border-2 border-gray-700"
    >
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 1.268-.63 2.39-1.593 3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043 3.296 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-3.296 1.043A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 12 21c-1.268 0-2.39-.63-3.068-1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1-3.296-1.043 3.745 3.745 0 0 1-1.043-3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.268.63-2.39 1.593-3.068a3.745 3.745 0 0 1 1.043-3.296 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296-1.043A3.746 3.746 0 0 1 12 3c1.268 0 2.39.63 3.068 1.593a3.746 3.746 0 0 1 3.296 1.043 3.746 3.746 0 0 1 1.043 3.296A3.745 3.745 0 0 1 21 12Z" />
    </svg>
    

      <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-600">Optimiza</h2>
      <p class="max-w-48 text-xs text-center text-gray-500 flex-1">
        Transforma y optimiza tu comercio con nuestro software de gestión
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
